WEBVTT

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.936
I am, I am. I am, Amen.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.936
DW: Wow, so fascinating.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.176
(Applause)

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.056
But what we learn from this experience

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.936
is the most powerful two words
in the English language is, "I am."

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.576
And we each have the capacity to love.

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:13.816
Thank you.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:18.200
(Applause)